---
title: Checkout service architecture
---
flowchart TB
    Customer([Customer])

    subgraph Clients
        direction LR
        Web[Web app]
        Mobile[Mobile app]
    end

    subgraph Services
        Gateway[API gateway]
        Auth[Auth service]
        Order[Order service]
        Worker[Worker]
    end

    subgraph Data
        direction LR
        Queue[[Queue]]
        DB[(Orders database)]
    end

    Customer --> Web
    Customer --> Mobile
    Web -- HTTPS --> Gateway
    Mobile -- HTTPS --> Gateway
    Gateway -- validates tokens --> Auth
    Gateway -- sends requests --> Order
    Order -- reads / writes --> DB
    Order -- publishes --> Queue
    Worker -- consumes from --> Queue
    Worker -- updates --> DB
